      "x": 80,
      "y": 2002,
      "width": 1150,
      "height": 37,
      "text": "Step 7 is the first write to the database, and step 5 is why: a row the chain has not confirmed is a claim,\nnot a record. Both paths record an event, so the activity log has no silent outcomes to reconcile later.",
      "originalText": "Step 7 is the first write to the database, and step 5 is why: a row the chain has not confirmed is a claim,\nnot a record. Both paths record an event, so the activity log has no silent outcomes to reconcile later.",
