      "id": "t456",
      "x": 80,
      "y": 2376,
      "width": 1150,
      "height": 37,
      "text": "The grant is on the record, not the name, so the same key that writes agent-endpoint[mcp] is refused on\nagent-context by the contract itself rather than by an application check.",
